"Rework color-tracking code to pass color thresholds to ``find_blobs()`` / "
"``find_markers()`` and iterate the flat blob-tuple list (:ref:`the "
"find_blobs rewrite <v1_4_0_findblobs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Kerjakan ulang kode pelacakan warna untuk meneruskan ambang batas warna ke "
"``find_blobs()`` / ``find_markers()`` dan mengiterasi daftar tuple blob "
"datar (\\ :ref:`penulisan ulang find_blobs <v1_4_0_findblobs>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:157
msgid ""
"Read centroid / orientation / pixel data from the blob tuples instead of the"
" removed standalone methods (:ref:`the removed image methods "
"<v1_4_0_removed>`)."
msgstr ""
"Baca data centroid / orientasi / piksel dari tuple blob alih-alih metode "
"mandiri yang dihapus (\\ :ref:`metode citra yang dihapus <v1_4_0_removed>`\\"
" )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:160
msgid ""
"Rename ``subimg`` → ``copy``, ``blit`` → ``replace``, fix ``blend()`` calls,"
" and replace ``scale`` / ``scaled`` / ``rainbow`` (:ref:`the imlib renames "
"<v1_4_0_imlibrename>`)."
msgstr ""
"Ubah nama ``subimg`` → ``copy``\\ , ``blit`` → ``replace``\\ , perbaiki "
"panggilan ``blend()``\\ , dan ganti ``scale`` / ``scaled`` / ``rainbow`` (\\"
" :ref:`perubahan nama imlib <v1_4_0_imlibrename>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:163
msgid ""
"Rename ``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()`` (:ref:`the find_eye rename "
"<v1_4_0_findeye>`) and ``compress()`` → ``compressed()`` (:ref:`the compress"
" rename <v1_4_0_compress>`)."
msgstr ""
"Ubah nama ``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()`` (\\ :ref:`perubahan nama find_eye"
" <v1_4_0_findeye>`\\ ) dan ``compress()`` → ``compressed()`` (\\ "
":ref:`perubahan nama compress <v1_4_0_compress>`\\ )."

